  ('reduce', 'A2', 'rɪˈdjuːs', 'v.', 'v. 减少，降低；（烹调中）使变浓稠，收汁', '[{"en":"The packets are measured to reduce waste.","zh":"测量包裹尺寸以减少浪费。"},{"en":"The government is looking to reduce inflation.","zh":"政府正在力求降低通货膨胀率。"},{"en":"These sunglasses are designed to reduce glare.","zh":"这些太阳镜是为减少刺眼的强光而设计的。"}]', 'size', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('refer', 'A2', 'rɪˈfɜː(r)', 'v.', 'v. 提到，谈及（refer to）；描述，涉及（refer to）', '[{"en":"You may refer to your notes if you want.","zh":"如果需要，可以查阅笔记。"},{"en":"They come from Tuam, a place they refer to on the title track of their album, \"All the Way From Tuam.\"","zh":"他们来自蒂厄姆，一个他们在专辑的标题曲《从蒂厄姆远路而来》中提到的地方。"},{"en":"May I refer you to my letter of 14 May?","zh":"你查看一下我5月14日给你的信好吗？"}]', 'communication', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('refuse', 'A2', 'rɪˈfjuːz', 'v.', 'v. 拒绝，回绝（做某事）；不接受，拒绝（别人给的东西）', '[{"en":"I could hardly refuse, could I?","zh":"我很难拒绝，是不是？"},{"en":"Can I refuse to give testimony?","zh":"我能拒绝作证吗？"},{"en":"Am I to understand that you refuse?","zh":"你是告诉我你拒绝了？"}]', 'space', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('region', 'A2', 'ˈriːdʒən', 'n.', 'n. 地区，区域；行政区', '[{"en":"Much of the region is lowland.","zh":"这地区大部分是低洼地。"},{"en":"This region is steeped in tradition.","zh":"这个地区有着深厚的传统。"},{"en":"The region is glutted with hospitals.","zh":"该地区的医院供过于求。"}]', 'society', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('regular', 'A2', 'ˈreɡjələ(r)', 'adj.', 'adj. 定期的，规律的；经常的，频繁的', '[{"en":"Do you take regular exercise?","zh":"你经常锻炼吗？"},{"en":"Regular exercise helps prevent weight gain.","zh":"经常锻炼有助于防止体重增加。"},{"en":"Employees make regular donations to charity.","zh":"员工们定期向慈善机构捐赠物品。"}]', 'time', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('relationship', 'A2', 'rɪˈleɪʃ(ə)nʃɪp', 'n.', 'n. （人、团体、国家等相互间的）关系；（人或事物之间的）关联，关系', '[{"en":"Their relationship flowered.","zh":"他们的关系变得更好了。"},{"en":"Their relationship soon went sour.","zh":"他们的关系很快有了嫌隙。"},{"en":"She is in a loveless relationship.","zh":"她身陷一段没有爱情的关系中。"}]', 'space', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('remove', 'A2', 'rɪˈmuːv', 'v.', 'vt. 移开，拿开；除去，废除', '[{"en":"Scuff marks from shoes are difficult to remove.","zh":"鞋上的擦痕很难去除。"},{"en":"The logical treatment is to remove this blockage.","zh":"合理的处理方法是清除这种堵塞物。"},{"en":"Once the turkey has defrosted, remove the giblets.","zh":"一旦火鸡解冻，立刻移除鸡杂。"}]', 'actions', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('repair', 'A2', 'rɪˈpeə(r)', 'v., n.', 'v. 修理，修补；补救，挽救（关系或声誉）', '[{"en":"I took my bike in for repair.","zh":"我把自行车送去修了。"},{"en":"The building was in need of repair.","zh":"这座大楼需要维修了。"},{"en":"We''ll repair it as quickly as possible.","zh":"我们会尽快把它修好的。"}]', 'society', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('replace', 'A2', 'rɪˈpleɪs', 'v.', 'v. 取代；（用……）替换，（以……）接替', '[{"en":"Have they found anyone to replace her yet?","zh":"他们找到了代替她的人没有？"},{"en":"He headed off efforts to replace him as leader.","zh":"他挫败了要取代他的领导地位的企图。"},{"en":"New laws will soon replace existing legislation.","zh":"新法律即将取代现行法规。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('reply', 'A2', 'rɪˈplaɪ', 'v., n.', 'v. 回答，答复；（以行动）作出回应，回击', '[{"en":"They received a negative reply.","zh":"他们得到一个否定的答复。"},{"en":"His reply was not repeatable.","zh":"他的回答不便重复。"},{"en":"Her reply was unprintable.","zh":"她的回答不宜被印刷出来。"}]', 'communication', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('reporter', 'A2', 'rɪˈpɔːtə(r)', 'n.', 'n. 记者，通讯员', '[{"en":"He is a 24-year-old trainee reporter.","zh":"他是一个24岁的实习记者。"},{"en":"He seemed too ingenuous for a reporter.","zh":"他好像太天真诚实，不适合做记者。"},{"en":"She was a TV reporter and worked long hours.","zh":"她曾是个电视记者，长时间工作。"}]', 'communication', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('request', 'A2', 'rɪˈkwest', 'n., v.', 'n. 要求，请求；要求的事，点播的歌曲', '[{"en":"Your request will be actioned.","zh":"你的要求会处理的。"},{"en":"They rebuffed her request for help.","zh":"他们拒绝了她的请求，不给她帮助。"},{"en":"His final request stopped her cold.","zh":"他最后的请求突然阻止了她。"}]', 'communication', 0, 0, 0, 'g9', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('research', 'A2', 'rɪˈsɜːtʃ', 'n., v.', 'n. （尤指大学或科研机构进行的）研究，探讨；研究工作，调查工作', '[{"en":"Embryo research is an emotive issue.","zh":"胚胎研究是个让人情绪激动的问题。"},{"en":"I''m doing some research on the subject.","zh":"我正就这一课题进行研究。"},{"en":"Research has so far proved inconclusive.","zh":"迄今为止研究还没有任何定论。"}]', 'education', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('researcher', 'A2', 'rɪˈsɜːtʃə(r); ˈriːsɜːtʃə(r)', 'n.', 'n.  研究人员', '[{"en":"He chose to join the company as a market researcher.","zh":"他选择加入这家公司当一名市场研究员。"},{"en":"Mr. Fay is to take up an appointment as a researcher.","zh":"费伊先生将担任研究员的职务。"},{"en":"Someone who lacks staying power and persistence is unlikely to make a good researcher.","zh":"缺乏耐力和毅力的人不可能成为一个出色的研究人员。"}]', 'education', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('respond', 'A2', 'rɪˈspɒnd', 'v.', 'v. （口头或书面）回答，回应；作出反应，回应', '[{"en":"I asked him his name, but he didn''t respond.","zh":"我问他叫什么名字，可他没回答。"},{"en":"The directors were unwilling to respond to questions.","zh":"董事们不愿意回答问题。"},{"en":"Some children respond more demonstratively than others.","zh":"一些孩子的反应比其他孩子的更感性。"}]', 'communication', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('response', 'A2', 'rɪˈspɒns', 'n.', 'n. 反应，响应；（口头或书面的）回复，答复', '[{"en":"His response was well balanced.","zh":"他的反应很沉着。"},{"en":"I think the response was good.","zh":"我认为这样的反应很有利。"},{"en":"His response was negative.","zh":"他的回答是否定的。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('rest', 'A2', '/rest/', 'n./v.', '休息；其余', '[{"en":"Have a rest.","zh":"休息一下。"},{"en":"The rest of the book.","zh":"书的其余部分。"}]', 'health', 1, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('review', 'A2', 'rɪˈvjuː', 'n., v.', 'n. 审查，检查；评论，评论文章', '[{"en":"The case is subject to judicial review.","zh":"这个案子必须接受司法审查。"},{"en":"He submitted his latest novel for review.","zh":"他提交了自己的最新小说供评论。"},{"en":"The review is a brilliant piece of writing.","zh":"这篇评论很精彩。"}]', 'health', 0, 0, 0, 'g9', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('ring', 'A2', '/rɪŋ/', 'n./v.', '戒指；铃响', '[{"en":"A gold ring.","zh":"一枚金戒指。"},{"en":"The phone rings.","zh":"电话铃响。"}]', 'clothes', 0, 0, 0, 'g7', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('rise', 'A2', '/raɪz/', 'v.', '升起；上升', '[{"en":"The sun rises.","zh":"太阳升起。"},{"en":"Prices rise.","zh":"价格上涨。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('rock', 'A2', '/rɒk/', 'n.', '岩石；摇滚乐', '[{"en":"A big rock.","zh":"一块大石头。"},{"en":"I like rock music.","zh":"我喜欢摇滚乐。"}]', 'nature', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('role', 'A2', 'rəʊl', 'n.', 'n. （演员的）角色；作用，职责', '[{"en":"He''s a natural for the role.","zh":"他是这个角色的最佳人选。"},{"en":"He won a BAFTA for the role.","zh":"他演出这个角色获得英国电影电视艺术学院奖。"},{"en":"His role has always been ambiguous.","zh":"他的角色一直不明确。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('roof', 'A2', 'ruːf', 'n.', 'n. 屋顶，车顶；（洞穴、矿井等的）顶部', '[{"en":"How long would the roof hold?","zh":"这屋顶还能支撑多久？"},{"en":"The roof was declared unsafe.","zh":"已宣布屋顶有安全隐患。"},{"en":"The roof is structurally unsound.","zh":"这屋顶结构不牢固。"}]', 'home', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997);
INSERT INTO words (word, level, ipa, pos, meaning, examples, category, common, extended, pep_only, grade, created_at, updated_at) VALUES
  ('round', 'A2', '/raʊnd/', 'adj./prep.', '圆的；环绕', '[{"en":"A round ball.","zh":"一个圆球。"},{"en":"Walk round the lake.","zh":"绕湖走。"}]', 'size', 1, 0, 0, 'g7', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('route', 'A2', 'ruːt', 'n.', 'n. 路线，航线；道路，路途', '[{"en":"The route is well signposted.","zh":"这条路线路标设置完善。"},{"en":"They kept to the preset route.","zh":"他们沿着事先规划的路线前进。"},{"en":"Which is the best route to take?","zh":"哪一条是最佳路线？"}]', 'travel', 0, 0, 0, 'g11', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('rubbish', 'A2', 'ˈrʌbɪʃ', 'n.', 'n. 垃圾，废弃物；毫无价值的东西，劣质产品', '[{"en":"It''s not rubbish—it''s true!","zh":"这不是瞎说—是真的！"},{"en":"Rubbish! You''re not fat.","zh":"瞎说！你并不胖。"},{"en":"He writes smug, sanctimonious rubbish.","zh":"他写的是自鸣得意、道貌岸然的垃圾。"}]', 'space', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('rude', 'A2', 'ruːd', 'adj.', 'adj. 粗鲁的，无礼的；粗俗的，下流的', '[{"en":"The man was downright rude to us.","zh":"这个家伙对我们无礼至极。"},{"en":"Why are you so rude to your mother?","zh":"你为什么对你的母亲这么没礼貌？"},{"en":"He became surly and rude toward me.","zh":"他变得对我粗暴无礼。"}]', 'people', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('runner', 'A2', 'ˈrʌnə(r)', 'n.', 'n. 跑步者；赛马', '[{"en":"So you''re a runner, huh?","zh":"这么说，你是个跑步爱好者喽？"},{"en":"The French runner is coming up fast on the inside.","zh":"法国的赛跑选手正从内圈迅速赶上来。"},{"en":"There was a suspicion that this runner attempted to avoid the procedures for drug testing.","zh":"存在这名赛跑运动员试图逃避药检的怀疑。"}]', 'arts', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('running', 'A2', 'ˈrʌnɪŋ', 'n.', 'n. 跑步，赛跑；管理，运作', '[{"en":"Running shoes have extra cushioning.","zh":"跑鞋有额外的减震设计。"},{"en":"Inflation was running at 26%.","zh":"通货膨胀达到了26%。"},{"en":"Stan had the chainsaw running.","zh":"斯坦开动了链锯。"}]', 'work', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('sadly', 'A2', 'ˈsædli', 'adv.', 'adv. 悲哀地；悲痛地', '[{"en":"Sadly, bamboo plants die after flowering.","zh":"令人遗憾的是，竹子开花后就会死亡。"},{"en":"Sadly when the lid of the boot sprang open, it was empty.","zh":"可惜，当后备箱盖弹开时，里面是空的。"},{"en":"Sadly, after eight years of marriage they had grown apart.","zh":"不幸的是，结婚八年后，他们的感情日渐淡漠了。"}]', 'emotions', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('safe', 'A2', '/seɪf/', 'adj.', '安全的', '[{"en":"A safe place.","zh":"一个安全的地方。"},{"en":"We are safe.","zh":"我们安全了。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('sail', 'A2', 'seɪl', 'v., n.', 'v. （人）航行；（船）航行', '[{"en":"We sail at 2 p.m. tomorrow.","zh":"我们明天下午两点起航。"},{"en":"We set sail (for France) at high tide.","zh":"我们在涨潮时起航（前往法国）。"},{"en":"Most visitors come to sail or windsurf.","zh":"游客大多是来进行帆船或帆板运动的。"}]', 'travel', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('sailing', 'A2', 'ˈseɪlɪŋ', 'n.', 'n. 帆船运动，乘帆船航行；水运航班', '[{"en":"We''re going sailing on Saturday.","zh":"我们打算星期六乘帆船出游。"},{"en":"Do you go sailing often?","zh":"你常去驾帆船玩吗？"},{"en":"Sailing is good fun.","zh":"帆船运动很有乐趣。"}]', 'travel', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('salary', 'A2', 'ˈsæləri', 'n.', 'n. 薪金，薪水', '[{"en":"His salary is now in six figures.","zh":"他的薪水现在是六位数。"},{"en":"The lawyer was paid a huge salary.","zh":"这个律师拿了很高的薪金。"},{"en":"Most of my salary goes on the rent.","zh":"我大部分工资都花在房租上了。"}]', 'work', 0, 0, 0, 'g12', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('sale', 'A2', 'seɪl', 'n.', 'n. 出售，销售；销售额（sales）', '[{"en":"Tickets go on sale this week.","zh":"票本周开始出售。"},{"en":"They''ve put their house up for sale.","zh":"他们的房子现在出售。"},{"en":"I''m sorry, it''s not for sale.","zh":"抱歉，这个不卖。"}]', 'shopping', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('sauce', 'A2', 'sɔːs', 'n.', 'n. 酱，调味汁；<美，非正式>烈酒（the sauce）', '[{"en":"This sauce is full of E-numbers.","zh":"这种调味汁尽是人造香料和色素。"},{"en":"This sauce has lumps in it.","zh":"这调味汁里有结块。"},{"en":"The sauce is mostly cream.","zh":"这沙司主要是奶油。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('save', 'A2', '/seɪv/', 'v.', '拯救；节省', '[{"en":"Save the cat.","zh":"救那只猫。"},{"en":"Save your money.","zh":"省钱。"}]', 'actions', 0, 0, 0, 'g7', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('scared', 'A2', 'skeəd', 'adj.', 'adj. 惊恐的，恐惧的；担心的，焦虑的', '[{"en":"I''m certainly not scared of him.","zh":"我当然不怕他。"},{"en":"Weren''t you just a weeny bit scared?","zh":"难道你就一点儿都不害怕吗？"},{"en":"You''ve got your rivals running scared.","zh":"你已经使对手感到恐惧了。"}]', 'emotions', 0, 0, 0, 'g7', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('scarf', 'A2', '/skɑːf/', 'n.', 'n. 围巾，披巾', '[{"en":"She wore a woollen scarf round her neck.","zh":"她脖子上围着一条羊毛围巾。"},{"en":"He wrapped a scarf around his face to keep warm.","zh":"他用围巾裹住脸保暖。"}]', 'clothes', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('scary', 'A2', 'ˈskeəri', 'adj.', 'adj. 骇人的，恐怖的；<非正式>异乎寻常的，令人惊奇的', '[{"en":"It was a really scary moment.","zh":"那一刻真是吓人。"},{"en":"It was kind of scary, like.","zh":"这可能是有几分可怕。"},{"en":"Sounds scary and interesting.","zh":"听上去很恐怖也很有意思。"}]', 'emotions', 0, 0, 0, 'g7', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('scene', 'A2', 'siːn', 'n.', 'n. 事发地，现场；事件，场面', '[{"en":"It''s a scene of complete devastation.","zh":"那是一幅满目疮痍的景象。"},{"en":"The carvings represent a hunting scene.","zh":"这些雕刻作品描绘了一幅狩猎的场面。"},{"en":"Firefighters were on the scene immediately.","zh":"消防队立刻赶到现场。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('schedule', 'A2', 'ˈʃedjuːl', 'n., v.', 'n. 计划（表），进度表；<美>（公共汽车、火车等的）时间表', '[{"en":"We have a very crowded schedule.","zh":"我们的日程排得满满的。"},{"en":"Everything went according to schedule.","zh":"一切都是按计划进行的。"},{"en":"We seem to have slipped behind schedule.","zh":"我们好像已经赶不上日程安排了。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('score', 'A2', '/skɔː(r)/', 'n./v.', '分数；得分', '[{"en":"A high score.","zh":"高分。"},{"en":"He scores a goal.","zh":"他进了一球。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g9', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('screen', 'A2', 'skriːn', 'n., v.', 'n. 屏幕，荧光屏；银幕', '[{"en":"Suddenly the screen went blank.","zh":"屏幕突然变成一片空白。"},{"en":"Todd stared stupidly at the screen.","zh":"托德呆呆地盯着屏幕。"},{"en":"The screen blanked out.","zh":"屏幕突然变成一片空白。"}]', 'science', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('search', 'A2', 'sɜːtʃ', 'n., v.', 'v. 搜查，搜寻；搜查（地方，车辆），搜……的身', '[{"en":"It was a fruitless search.","zh":"那是一次毫无结果的搜寻。"},{"en":"They commenced a systematic search.","zh":"他们开始了系统的搜查。"},{"en":"You can''t rush a search.","zh":"你不能匆忙做搜寻工作。"}]', 'space', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('season', 'A2', '/ˈsiːzn/', 'n.', '季节', '[{"en":"Spring is a season.","zh":"春天是一个季节。"},{"en":"Four seasons.","zh":"四个季节。"}]', 'nature', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('seat', 'A2', '/siːt/', 'n.', '座位', '[{"en":"An empty seat.","zh":"一个空座位。"},{"en":"Take a seat.","zh":"请坐。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('secondly', 'A2', 'ˈsekəndli', 'adv.', 'adv. 其次；第二', '[{"en":"Firstly, it''s expensive, and secondly, it''s too slow.","zh":"首先是价格贵，其次，速度太慢。"},{"en":"It makes you look firstly at how you''re treated and secondly how you treat everybody else.","zh":"它让你首先看别人怎样对待你，其次看你怎样对待别人。"},{"en":"First of all, there are not many of them, and secondly, they have little money and, thirdly, they''re hungry.","zh":"首先，他们人数不多；第二，他们没什么钱；第三，他们在挨饿。"}]', 'numbers', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('secret', 'A2', 'ˈsiːkrət', 'adj., n.', 'adj. 秘密的，保密的；（感情、担心、行动）不公开的，暗自的', '[{"en":"The meeting was held in secret.","zh":"会议是秘密召开的。"},{"en":"Can you keep a secret ?","zh":"你能保守秘密吗？"},{"en":"Can you keep a secret?","zh":"你能保守秘密吗？"}]', 'emotions', 0, 0, 0, 'g9', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('secretary', 'A2', 'ˈsekrət(ə)ri', 'n.', 'n. 秘书；书记员，干事', '[{"en":"She can''t do without a secretary.","zh":"她不能没有秘书。"},{"en":"We hired a new secretary.","zh":"我们雇了一名新秘书。"},{"en":"I was a lousy secretary.","zh":"我曾是个蹩脚的秘书。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'primary', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('seem', 'A2', 'siːm', 'v.', 'v. （涉及推断）似乎，看来；（用于表示谨慎、礼貌或委婉）好像，可能', '[{"en":"We seem destined never to meet.","zh":"我们似乎是命中注定无缘相见。"},{"en":"Her claims seem credible to many.","zh":"她的说法似乎在许多人看来是可信的。"},{"en":"They seem an ill-assorted couple.","zh":"他俩似乎不般配。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g8', 1793800997, 1793800997),
