  ('explore', 'B1', 'ɪkˈsplɔː(r)', 'v.', 'v. 探讨，探究；考察，探索', '[{"en":"We will explore every avenue until we find an answer.","zh":"我们要探索一切途径，直到找到答案为止。"},{"en":"I want to explore and get in touch with my inner self.","zh":"我想认真探索，了解我内在的个性。"},{"en":"I just wanted to explore on my own.","zh":"我只是想独自考察一下。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
