  ('familiar', 'B1', 'fəˈmɪliə(r)', 'adj.', 'adj. 熟悉的；常见的，普通的', '[{"en":"He was humming a familiar tune.","zh":"他低声哼着一支熟悉的小曲。"},{"en":"He felt a longing for the familiar.","zh":"他渴望熟悉的氛围。"},{"en":"The town was weirdly familiar.","zh":"这个城镇怪面熟的。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
