  ('nightmare', 'B2', 'ˈnaɪtmeə(r)', 'n.', 'n. 噩梦；可怕的经历，很难对付的人（或情形）', '[{"en":"Maureen put the nightmare behind her.","zh":"莫琳将噩梦抛诸脑后。"},{"en":"His abrasive wit and caustic comments were an interviewer''s nightmare.","zh":"他粗鲁的风趣和刻薄的评论是采访者的噩梦。"},{"en":"They began to recover slowly from their nightmare of pain and suffering.","zh":"他们开始从痛苦的噩梦中慢慢恢复过来。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g12', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('notion', 'B2', 'ˈnəʊʃ(ə)n', 'n.', 'n. 概念，想法；缝纫用品', '[{"en":"She had only a vague notion of what might happen.","zh":"对于可能发生的事她只有一个模糊的概念。"},{"en":"It might be considered heresy to suggest such a notion.","zh":"提出这样的见解可能会被认为是异端邪说。"},{"en":"I still believe in the notion of an egalitarian society.","zh":"我仍然相信平等主义社会的理念。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g12', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('numerous', 'B2', 'ˈnjuːmərəs', 'adj.', 'adj. 众多的，许多的', '[{"en":"Numerous marriages now end in divorce.","zh":"现在许多婚姻都以离婚而告终。"},{"en":"Wild boar are numerous in the valleys.","zh":"这些山谷里有无数的野猪。"},{"en":"He has been late on numerous occasions.","zh":"他已经迟到过无数次了。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g11', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('obey', 'B2', 'əˈbeɪ', 'v.', 'v. 遵守，服从，听从；<非正式>顺……的意，按……的通常情况行事', '[{"en":"Dogs can be trained to obey orders.","zh":"狗可以训练得听从命令。"},{"en":"It was his duty to obey.","zh":"服从是他的职责。"},{"en":"You must obey the captain''s commands.","zh":"你必须服从船长的命令。"}]', 'time', 0, 0, 0, 'g11', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('objective', 'B2', 'əbˈdʒektɪv', 'n., adj.', 'n. 目的，目标；出击目标（尤指在军事攻击中)', '[{"en":"What is the main objective of this project?","zh":"这个项目的主要目标是什么？"},{"en":"Winning is not the prime objective in this sport.","zh":"获胜不是这项体育运动的主要目的。"},{"en":"Our objective must be to secure a peace settlement.","zh":"我们的目标必须是确保达成一个和平协议。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g11', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('obligation', 'B2', 'ˌɒblɪˈɡeɪʃ(ə)n', 'n.', 'n. （法律上或道义上的）义务，责任；恩惠，人情债', '[{"en":"We have a moral obligation to protect the environment.","zh":"我们有道义责任保护环境。"},{"en":"She did not feel under any obligation to tell him the truth.","zh":"她觉得没有义务告诉他实情。"},{"en":"Governments have at least a moral obligation to answer these questions.","zh":"政府至少在道义上有责任回应这些问题。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('observation', 'B2', 'ˌɒbzəˈveɪʃ(ə)n', 'n.', 'n. 观察，监视；观察力', '[{"en":"She has good powers of observation.","zh":"她有很强的观察力。"},{"en":"Is that a criticism or just an observation?","zh":"那是一种批评呢，还是一种观察评论而已？"},{"en":"The diaries are a mixture of confession and observation.","zh":"这些日记混合着自白和一些观察。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g12', 1793800997, 1793800997),
  ('observe', 'B2', 'əbˈzɜːv', 'v.', 'v. 注意到，观察到；注视，监视', '[{"en":"The scientists will study the variety of trees and observe which are fruiting.","zh":"科学家们将研究树木的多样性并观察哪些树木结果实。"},{"en":"Jack was careful to observe the proprieties, treating her with exaggerated respect.","zh":"杰克谨慎遵守礼节，对她过分尊重。"},{"en":"Imposing speed restrictions is easy, but forcing drivers to observe them is trickier.","zh":"实行速度限制容易，而迫使司机遵守较难。"}]', 'thinking', 0, 0, 0, 'g10', 1793800997, 1793800997),
