  ('parliament', 'B2', 'ˈpɑːləmənt', 'n.', 'n. 议会，国会；英国议会（包括下议院和上议院）（Parliament）', '[{"en":"They bulldozed the tax through Parliament.","zh":"他们使税收提案在议会强行通过。"},{"en":"The German parliament is called the ''Bundestag''.","zh":"德国的议会称为Bundestag。"},{"en":"Parliament passed the bill without further amendment.","zh":"议会未作进一步修改便通过了议案。"}]', 'society', 0, 0, 0, 'g12', 1793800997, 1793800997),
